{"4659660":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Graveyard Cabin","steam_appid":4659660,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>An Interactive FMV Anomaly Experience: Watch the Tapes, Watch Your Back.<\/strong><\/i><\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong> <\/strong><\/i><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Graveyard Cabin <\/strong>is a psychological FMV anomaly horror game where observation is your only weapon.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work the night shift inside an isolated graveyard security cabin and monitor a network of black-and-white surveillance cameras. Detect anomalies, report supernatural activity, and survive until morning.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4659660\/extras\/2494bb953e0335cf6ee5a4fe12899118.poster.avif?t=1793639542\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4659660\/extras\/2494bb953e0335cf6ee5a4fe12899118.webm?t=1793639542\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4659660\/extras\/2494bb953e0335cf6ee5a4fe12899118.mp4?t=1793639542\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Spot the Anomalies<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Memorize every corner of the graveyard and carefully monitor the live camera feeds.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a gravestone moves, a figure appears, or something changes unexpectedly, report it before it’s too late.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful...<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Too many false reports will anger the entities hunting you.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You only have 3 chances.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4659660\/extras\/d1ef7d808c6d11077bbcbc79005fa535.poster.avif?t=1793639542\" width=780 height=434 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4659660\/extras\/d1ef7d808c6d11077bbcbc79005fa535.webm?t=1793639542\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4659660\/extras\/d1ef7d808c6d11077bbcbc79005fa535.mp4?t=1793639542\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>If You Hear Crying, Hide<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every anomaly should be observed.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you hear the crying of a little girl, immediately shut down the cameras and stay silent in the dark until the sound disappears.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looking too long may attract something you cannot escape.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4659660\/extras\/7f15ec8b30e49289b213b012800bed59.poster.avif?t=1793639542\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4659660\/extras\/7f15ec8b30e49289b213b012800bed59.webm?t=1793639542\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4659660\/extras\/7f15ec8b30e49289b213b012800bed59.mp4?t=1793639542\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Cabin Is Not Safe<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The danger is not limited to the cameras.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While monitoring the graveyard, supernatural entities can appear inside the cabin itself. Check the internal cabin camera frequently and stay alert to movement beside you… or directly behind you.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The observer can quickly become the victim.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4659660\/extras\/d150a666c188b64c8950624ba90af14a.poster.avif?t=1793639542\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4659660\/extras\/d150a666c188b64c8950624ba90af14a.webm?t=1793639542\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4659660\/extras\/d150a666c188b64c8950624ba90af14a.mp4?t=1793639542\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defend<\/strong> <strong>Yourself<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If an entity breaches the cabin, you must react instantly.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the Cross against hostile creatures.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the Amulet to banish the Dead Woman.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the wrong item or hesitate for even a second and your shift will end permanently. <br> <\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological FMV horror experience<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anomaly detection gameplay<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple supernatural entities<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surveillance camera monitoring mechanics<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Audio-based survival mechanics<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defensive item system<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increasing tension and paranoia<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive graveyard atmosphere<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you survive until morning, or will the graveyard claim its newest resident?<\/p>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>An Interactive FMV Anomaly Experience: Watch the Tapes, Watch Your Back.<\/strong><\/i><\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong> <\/strong><\/i><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Graveyard Cabin <\/strong>is a psychological FMV anomaly horror game where observation is your only weapon.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work the night shift inside an isolated graveyard security cabin and monitor a network of black-and-white surveillance cameras. Detect anomalies, report supernatural activity, and survive until morning.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4659660\/extras\/2494bb953e0335cf6ee5a4fe12899118.poster.avif?t=1793639542\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4659660\/extras\/2494bb953e0335cf6ee5a4fe12899118.webm?t=1793639542\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4659660\/extras\/2494bb953e0335cf6ee5a4fe12899118.mp4?t=1793639542\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Spot the Anomalies<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Memorize every corner of the graveyard and carefully monitor the live camera feeds.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a gravestone moves, a figure appears, or something changes unexpectedly, report it before it’s too late.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful...<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Too many false reports will anger the entities hunting you.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You only have 3 chances.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4659660\/extras\/d1ef7d808c6d11077bbcbc79005fa535.poster.avif?t=1793639542\" width=780 height=434 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4659660\/extras\/d1ef7d808c6d11077bbcbc79005fa535.webm?t=1793639542\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4659660\/extras\/d1ef7d808c6d11077bbcbc79005fa535.mp4?t=1793639542\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>If You Hear Crying, Hide<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every anomaly should be observed.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you hear the crying of a little girl, immediately shut down the cameras and stay silent in the dark until the sound disappears.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looking too long may attract something you cannot escape.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4659660\/extras\/7f15ec8b30e49289b213b012800bed59.poster.avif?t=1793639542\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4659660\/extras\/7f15ec8b30e49289b213b012800bed59.webm?t=1793639542\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4659660\/extras\/7f15ec8b30e49289b213b012800bed59.mp4?t=1793639542\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Cabin Is Not Safe<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The danger is not limited to the cameras.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While monitoring the graveyard, supernatural entities can appear inside the cabin itself. Check the internal cabin camera frequently and stay alert to movement beside you… or directly behind you.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The observer can quickly become the victim.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4659660\/extras\/d150a666c188b64c8950624ba90af14a.poster.avif?t=1793639542\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4659660\/extras\/d150a666c188b64c8950624ba90af14a.webm?t=1793639542\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4659660\/extras\/d150a666c188b64c8950624ba90af14a.mp4?t=1793639542\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defend<\/strong> <strong>Yourself<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If an entity breaches the cabin, you must react instantly.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the Cross against hostile creatures.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the Amulet to banish the Dead Woman.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the wrong item or hesitate for even a second and your shift will end permanently. <br> <\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological FMV horror experience<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anomaly detection gameplay<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple supernatural entities<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surveillance camera monitoring mechanics<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Audio-based survival mechanics<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defensive item system<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increasing tension and paranoia<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive graveyard atmosphere<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you survive until morning, or will the graveyard claim its newest resident?<\/p>","short_description":"An FMV anomaly horror game. You are a night guard at a desolate graveyard. Monitor the cameras, spot the unnatural, and survive.","supported_languages":"English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Russian, Turkish, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4659660\/37acf9aa66f1ae2d50722f70f8bd8a10dde6ee22\/header.jpg?t=1793639542","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4659660\/1d880f92e40b321c53f78336ceae04a6b97a4d5b\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793639542","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4659660\/1d880f92e40b321c53f78336ceae04a6b97a4d5b\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793639542","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10+ 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i3-6100 \/ AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Intel UHD 630 \/ NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750 \/ AMD Radeon RX 550 or equivalent<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 2 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10+ x64<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-8400 \/ AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br><\/li><li><stron